evreuse","r":[0.1231,0.6867,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Clorinde","r":[0.1648,0.6867,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Durin","r":[0.2065,0.6867,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Valeriy","r":[0.0815,0.7437,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Mitya","r":[0.1648,0.7437,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.2065,0.7437,0.0343,0.0274]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/valeriy/261111-225334/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Summit Shaper","text":"Summit Shaper gives Valeriy massive ATK scaling, strengthening his ATK-based shields and support buffs/increases ATK when shielded."},{"name":"Skyward Blade","text":"High Base ATK boosts his support scaling, while ER improves Burst uptime."},{"name":"Calamity of Eshu","text":"ATK strengthens Valeriy’s shield and buffs; its attack passive works only while shielded."},{"name":"Amenoma Kageuchi","text":"Amenoma Kageuchi provides substantial ATK% and passive Energy restoration, helping Valeriy maintain his Burst uptime."},{"name":"Finale of the Deep","text":"Provides ATK% and an additional ATK increase after using a Skill. Its Bond of Life mechanic is best handled with reliable healing."},{"name":"Sacrificial Sword","text":"Energy Recharge and Skill cooldown reset on Skill damage; extra casts depend on proc chance."},{"name":"Favonius Sword","text":"Energy Recharge and team particles on CRIT; plan enough CRIT Rate for procs."},{"name":"Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","text":"Free Energy Recharge sword with extra Skill CRIT Rate and temporary ER after Skill."}],"a":[{"names":["Heart of the Furnace"],"text":"Heart of the Furnace boosts Valeriy's ATK and can provide a massive teamwide Stellar Glimmer DMG bonus when he triggers the reaction.","stats":"ATK%/ER% · ATK% · ATK%/CR"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Noblesse Oblige is a strong alternative for Valeriy, providing a 20% teamwide ATK buff after his Burst, especially when another teammate already carries Heart of the Furnace.","stats":""},{"names":["Gladiator's Finale","Heart of the Furnace"],"text":"Combines two ATK bonuses for a simple support build when a suitable four-piece set is unavailable.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Current Situation","members":["Valeriy","Odette","Mitya","Sucrose"],"text":"Mitya drives SSC damage, Odette amplifies reactions, Sucrose boosts EM and shreds RES, and Valeriy provides buffs and team support.","roles":["Support","Buffs","Main DPS","EM Build"]},{"name":"Short Circuit","members":["Valeriy","Odette","Cyno","Sucrose"],"text":"Cyno drives sustained Electro damage, Odette amplifies reactions, Sucrose boosts EM and shreds RES, and Valeriy provides buffs and team support.","roles":["Support","Buffs","Main DPS","EM Build"]},{"name":"Guilty as Charged","members":["Valeriy","Chevreuse","Clorinde","Durin"],"text":"Clorinde drives Electro damage, Durin enables reactions, Chevreuse boosts Overloaded damage and shreds RES, while Valeriy provides buffs and team support.","roles":["Support","Healer / Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer"]},{"name":"Budget Conductors","members":["Valeriy","Traveler (Cryo)","Mitya","Sucrose"],"text":"Mitya drives SSC damage, Cryo Traveler supports Cryo application, Sucrose boosts EM and shreds RES, and Valeriy provides buffs and team support.","roles":["Support","Buffs","Main DPS","EM Build"]}],"v":"Stellar Shield Support: Protect the carry while providing specialized reaction buffs.\nGeneral Burst Support: A generic support option outside specialized Conduct teams.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["Stellar Support"],"about":"Valeriy is a flexible support who provides shielding and buffs Electro teams, especially those built around SSC. Best in teams that can fully use his buffs. He is a specialized support.","pros":["Strong Shield","Electro DMG Buff","Off-Field Electro","Low Field Time","Easy ATK Build"],"cons":["Stellar-Conduct Biased","Needs Charge Management","ER Hungry","Limited Team Flexibility"],"weapons":["Summit Shaper","Skyward Blade","Calamity of Eshu","Amenoma Kageuchi","Finale of the Deep","Sacrificial Sword","Favoniu